Date: Mon, 15 Jun 2026 23:45:07 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: add AgentLine telephony tool node
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

AgentLine is an AI-native telephony platform that gives AI agents real phone numbers, human-like voices, and the ability to make/receive phone calls autonomously.

New files:

- credentials/AgentLineApi.credential.ts — API key + base URL credential

- nodes/tools/AgentLine/AgentLine.ts — Tool node with 12 operations

- nodes/tools/AgentLine/core.ts — LangChain Tool implementation

- nodes/tools/AgentLine/agentline.png — Official logo

- nodes/tools/AgentLine/agentline.svg — SVG logo fallback
