From: Sameersribot <sameersrivastava5056@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:07:39 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix: address code review feedback from Gemini and Copilot

- Use secureFetch instead of global fetch to prevent SSRF attacks

- Validate baseUrl scheme (only https/http allowed)

- Add AbortController timeout (30s) to prevent hung connections

- Use parseJsonBody for robust LLM JSON parsing

- Fix ID key deletion: delete the actual matched key

- Remove unused getOperationOptions export

- Remove SVG logo (only official PNG logo used)
